    description: "UAT 2026-04-13 BUG-11: shellcheck uses Template Haskell `$forAllProperties` to discover and run 2,214 `prop_*` test functions. Tool reports 0% coverage, making test-coverage unusable for Haskell projects with property-based testing. Per UAT: 'P2 for prioritization, P0 if Haskell is a priority'. Fix: heuristic recognition of `prop_*` functions in Haskell test files OR explicit Template Haskell expansion (the structural fix)."  # f0be
